[{"title":"逢继周长者桥梓","author":"黄毓祺","text":"神仙是假隐非真，拄杖翛然斗笠贫。\n当日吴门为乞子，今朝石室是累臣。\n孔融慷慨能留我，张俭低回却累人。\n此地重逢肠已断，凄然无泪可沾巾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21575,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日同诸兄弟小饮","author":"黄毓祺","text":"参军落帽已千秋，戏马台空麋鹿游。\n鸟在笼中犹自爱，萍浮水上若相求。\n百年衰鬓黄花节，四海深杯白鹭洲。\n何必登高才作赋，悲歌画地亦风流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21576,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绝命词","author":"黄毓祺","text":"人间忠孝颇平常，墙壁为心铁石肠。\n拟向虚空擎日月，曾于梦幻历冰霜。\n岩头百里清音吼，师子千寻白乳长。\n示现不妨为厉鬼，云旗风马昼飞扬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21577,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪异","author":"黄毓祺","text":"五更吹角夜吹笳，无复秦淮旧酒家。\n小雪今朝仍李实，严霜昨夜尚荷花。\n渔阳世事唐天宝，江左人心晋永嘉。\n纵使乾坤皆反覆，敢云吾道故龙蛇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21578,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬至日口占","author":"黄毓祺","text":"日行南至转无聊，满眼香从甚处消。\n囚服自知惭管仲，纸钱谁为祭皋陶。\n愁随弱线偏增长，泪滴寒灰亦动摇。\n万死孤臣空有梦，雁书不到御床遥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21579,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦变为虎戏成","author":"黄毓祺","text":"虎鼠龙蛇转盼中，人生变幻孰能穷。\n觉来犹是寻常我，梦去分明大小空。\n自顾爪牙牛鹿怖，肯教文采犬羊同。\n玉门关外头颅老，侯印何年出汉宫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21580,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"守岁","author":"黄毓祺","text":"微茫炤影一镫残，追数从前绪万端。\n慷慨有头迎白刃，飘零无梦到黄冠。\n思亲地下伤心极，忆妹天涯会面难。\n此夕一杯难强进，春风送暖骨犹寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21581,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己丑岁朝","author":"黄毓祺","text":"秋风匏檕石头城，时序催人弈屡更。\n独抱此心仍岁晚，不知今日是春正。\n摩空莫笑雕笼翠，伏枥长愁卷旆钲。\n何处早朝诸侍从，云移扇影静无声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21582,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"生日","author":"黄毓祺","text":"枉余堕地是男儿，春色平分月似规。\n幸值神宗全盛日，况当先子壮游时。\n乾坤反覆今缧绁，岁月蹉跎合涕洟。\n见说家乡飘荡尽，故人曾否问恒饥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21583,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"友人为予治木口占博笑","author":"黄毓祺","text":"七尺昂藏亦幻形，头颅不敢负朝廷。\n鸢乌应怪丹心苦，蝼蚁宁嫌碧血腥。\n何必达摩留双履，底须普化振空铃。\n桐棺三寸人间世，寒食荒郊草自青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21584,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拂水","author":"黄毓祺","text":"传闻此间水，瀑布半空落。\n惜哉我来游，霜降水始涸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21585,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"桃源","author":"黄毓祺","text":"岁晏桃源行，源上空人家。\n我欲于此石，洒墨成桃花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21586,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"维摩寺","author":"黄毓祺","text":"秋雨复秋风，萧然来丈室。\n予亦善病人，怜尔维摩诘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21587,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"剑门","author":"黄毓祺","text":"片石高于天，胡然而中劈。\n长剑倚天外，此是试剑石。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21588,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻犬","author":"黄毓祺","text":"柴门闻犬吠，风雨娄江道。\n却忆华子冈，月夜声如豹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21589,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏堤","author":"黄毓祺","text":"日夕堤上行，古木馀衰柳。\n可怜元祐间，杭州苏太守。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21590,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"放鹤亭","author":"黄毓祺","text":"昔人有养鹤，放之足使令。\n鹤去人亦去，兀然空一亭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21591,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雷峰塔","author":"黄毓祺","text":"塔顶草茸茸，有如发不剃。\n原是螺髻塔，是以现螺髻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21592,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石屋洞","author":"黄毓祺","text":"閒坐屋子下，片石亦所欲。\n何意于眼前，突兀见此屋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21593,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"万年宫","author":"黄毓祺","text":"夜宿武夷宫，向君揖而笑。\n我闻浩劫长，万年年最少。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21594,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"汉祀亭","author":"黄毓祺","text":"借问汉祀亭，何如集灵台。\n茂陵秋草绿，汉武非仙才。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21595,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十三仙","author":"黄毓祺","text":"当闻酒仙语，爱酒不愧天。\n胡为群仙谪，一往八百年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21596,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张仙岩","author":"黄毓祺","text":"知母忆子心，母子当相守。\n纵使游太清，能无一回首。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21597,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"狮子峰","author":"黄毓祺","text":"悬崖绝壁间，踞地有如此。\n汝若解翻身，是名真狮子。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21598,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兜鍪峰","author":"黄毓祺","text":"青山非战场，用武何为者。\n请君去危冠，露顶松风下。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21599,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铁板嶂","author":"黄毓祺","text":"丹山碧水中，独黑何傲岸。\n石丈倘参禅，居然是铁汉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21600,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"翰墨岩","author":"黄毓祺","text":"何年片墨悬，磨人自今古。\n文字障未空，山水亦良苦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21601,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎鼻石","author":"黄毓祺","text":"石虎踞当途，鼻孔谁能共。\n倘遇苏子瞻，缩为怪石供。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21602,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤壁峰","author":"黄毓祺","text":"鹤影如人长，黄州秋月白。\n谁知此山中，亦自有赤壁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21603,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题诗岩","author":"黄毓祺","text":"不见题诗人，诗亦苍苔没。\n夜深炤岩前，犹是太古月。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21604,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仙床石","author":"黄毓祺","text":"困来枕石头，长伸两脚睡。\n只恐登斯床，又梦游仙事。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21605,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"罗汉岩","author":"黄毓祺","text":"有如须菩提，宴坐于岩畔。\n石终不自言，我得阿罗汉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21606,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"紫阳书院","author":"黄毓祺","text":"伊人云逝矣，晚对淡烟横。\n万古心安在，君听欸乃声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21607,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"云窝","author":"黄毓祺","text":"因崖能割胜，九曲正平分。\n今夜云窝客，酣眠何处云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21608,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"更衣台","author":"黄毓祺","text":"仙人更委蜕，亦作姤衣观。\n正法眼觑之，尸解犹钝汉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21609,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仙迹岩","author":"黄毓祺","text":"胡跪石亦穿，求道庶乎可。\n不见雪齐腰，断臂安心者。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21610,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苍屏","author":"黄毓祺","text":"晏罢彩虹飞，美人隔罗幔。\n路远莫致之，报君苍玉案。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21611,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三仰峰","author":"黄毓祺","text":"婆娑三老翁，幻作山头石。\n仰面看青天，去天不盈尺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21612,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"北廊岩","author":"黄毓祺","text":"小艇傍回廊，盘旋岂有极。\n溪山无准绳，南观却成北。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21613,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"猫儿石","author":"黄毓祺","text":"休嫌不捕狸，局足巉岩下。\n见说死猫头，无人能著价。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21614,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"钟模石","author":"黄毓祺","text":"兹山非石钟，留最钟模冷。\n山空钟未鸣，令人发深省。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21615,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"百花庄","author":"黄毓祺","text":"春至百花开，无花亦不恶。\n欲知天下秋，风前一叶落。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21616,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丹霞嶂","author":"黄毓祺","text":"遥望层楼丹，飞霞错如绮。\n斧凿岂人工，号曰天然子。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21617,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"玉柱峰","author":"黄毓祺","text":"峨眉积雪中，突兀天之半。\n不知何代人，见此白石烂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21618,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"火燄峰","author":"黄毓祺","text":"譬诸大火聚，光燄高摩空。\n我欲如胜热，投身住此中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21619,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"漂涧","author":"黄毓祺","text":"临淮淮水水茫茫，漂涧于今尚侠香。\n曾是王孙沦落处，萋萋芳草断人肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21620,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望九里山","author":"黄毓祺","text":"十面奇兵九里藏，可怜走狗为谁忙。\n行人马上频回首，今日青山古战场。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21621,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳絮","author":"黄毓祺","text":"堤上东风杨柳斜，半飞柳絮半飞沙。\n可怜一样风前絮，惟有江南似雪花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21622,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆亡弟","author":"黄毓祺","text":"此世那能住此人，未年三十即无身。\n阿兄欲泣翻成笑，白藕花中又一春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21623,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寻黄金台不见","author":"黄毓祺","text":"我来怀古只悲凉，目断金台何处黄。\n一夜天阴风雨湿，犹闻死马哭昭王。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21624,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同长蘅西湖望月","author":"黄毓祺","text":"片月高悬似镜明，不知身在镜中行。\n林空夜静无啼鸟，何处吹来唤虎声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21625,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臣虞杂取米盐琐事，成二十四诗，余读而悲之，勉答其半，韵既不次，语复不伦。亦犹杜陵野老同元使君春陵行，非敢云属和也 其一 薪","author":"黄毓祺","text":"今年锥与地俱空，兀坐风吹雨打中。\n忽报朝来薪亦尽，灶前失却丙丁童。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21626,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臣虞杂取米盐琐事，成二十四诗，余读而悲之，勉答其半，韵既不次，语复不伦。亦犹杜陵野老同元使君春陵行，非敢云属和也 其二 粟","author":"黄毓祺","text":"瓮头饥鼠夜嗟吁，米价频年玉与珠。\n折脚铛煨缨络粥，家风长自忆龙须。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21627,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臣虞杂取米盐琐事，成二十四诗，余读而悲之，勉答其半，韵既不次，语复不伦。亦犹杜陵野老同元使君春陵行，非敢云属和也 其三 膏","author":"黄毓祺","text":"深居暗室免飞虫，时步空庭白月中。\n但恨相逢高索价，无人捉破卖油翁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21628,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臣虞杂取米盐琐事，成二十四诗，余读而悲之，勉答其半，韵既不次，语复不伦。亦犹杜陵野老同元使君春陵行，非敢云属和也 其四 盐","author":"黄毓祺","text":"胡乱何妨信手拈，宗风于载绝廉纤。\n阿侬也吸西江水，愧杀当年不少盐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21629,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臣虞杂取米盐琐事，成二十四诗，余读而悲之，勉答其半，韵既不次，语复不伦。亦犹杜陵野老同元使君春陵行，非敢云属和也 其五 泉","author":"黄毓祺","text":"枕上遥闻转辘轳，朝厨汲井已全枯。\n邻翁手段茱萸辣，乞水公然一滴无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21630,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臣虞杂取米盐琐事，成二十四诗，余读而悲之，勉答其半，韵既不次，语复不伦。亦犹杜陵野老同元使君春陵行，非敢云属和也 其六 药","author":"黄毓祺","text":"采药何尝走百城，一茎拈起可怜生。\n有无甲乙更相代，杀活同时却两行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21631,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臣虞杂取米盐琐事，成二十四诗，余读而悲之，勉答其半，韵既不次，语复不伦。亦犹杜陵野老同元使君春陵行，非敢云属和也 其七 钱","author":"黄毓祺","text":"阿堵于今日以纷，临风荷叶舞轻云。\n空囊自笑长汀子，何处逢人乞一文。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21632,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臣虞杂取米盐琐事，成二十四诗，余读而悲之，勉答其半，韵既不次，语复不伦。亦犹杜陵野老同元使君春陵行，非敢云属和也 其八 柴","author":"黄毓祺","text":"运水搬柴太瘦生，幞头著价更纵横。\n庞公应被天然笑，佛殿何须草数茎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21633,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臣虞杂取米盐琐事，成二十四诗，余读而悲之，勉答其半，韵既不次，语复不伦。亦犹杜陵野老同元使君春陵行，非敢云属和也 其九 绵","author":"黄毓祺","text":"黄绵袄子易经过，夜坐其如彻骨何。\n我手倘然同佛手，袖中少许是兜罗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21634,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臣虞杂取米盐琐事，成二十四诗，余读而悲之，勉答其半，韵既不次，语复不伦。亦犹杜陵野老同元使君春陵行，非敢云属和也 其十 菜","author":"黄毓祺","text":"携筐入市价难酬，薄暮无鱼归去休。\n岂是悬丝空钓月，金鳞昨夜又离钩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21635,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臣虞杂取米盐琐事，成二十四诗，余读而悲之，勉答其半，韵既不次，语复不伦。亦犹杜陵野老同元使君春陵行，非敢云属和也 其十一 鱼","author":"黄毓祺","text":"埋没嘉蔬古所叹，清晨犹得仰园官。\n感时借问端狮子，成佛何如吃菜难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21636,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臣虞杂取米盐琐事，成二十四诗，余读而悲之，勉答其半，韵既不次，语复不伦。亦犹杜陵野老同元使君春陵行，非敢云属和也 其十二 炭","author":"黄毓祺","text":"蒲团一具在家僧，枯木岩前得未曾。\n见说三冬无煖气，镬汤炉炭冷于冰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21637,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊花 其一","author":"黄毓祺","text":"冬心寥落向谁论，雅正斯为独立人。\n不见疏疏三两蕊，群花塞默少精神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21638,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊花 其二","author":"黄毓祺","text":"悠然入骨是寒清，山远烟微起暮情。\n秀色有无难可饱，九华空服笑泉明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21639,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊花 其三","author":"黄毓祺","text":"修翎整整复斜斜，肯受寻常耳目加。\n独立徘徊君自悟，古人微尚在黄花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21640,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊花 其四","author":"黄毓祺","text":"閒庭瘦影无婆娑，磊落如人野意多。\n举世自张鹑鴳网，云中白鹤岂能罗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21641,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊花 其五","author":"黄毓祺","text":"寒花淡淡立幽轩，静对能空物性喧。\n四座微闻声叹息，主人萧寂独无言。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21642,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊花 其六","author":"黄毓祺","text":"佳色繇来莫可名，夕阳彩翠甚分明。\n谁知别有娟娟意，最是空庭白月横。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21643,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊花 其七","author":"黄毓祺","text":"远性偏于静者宜，天然秀整是风期。\n结庐人境堪怡悦，不分高山有紫芝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21644,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊花 其八","author":"黄毓祺","text":"冥心不共世低昂，白露凄然水面凉。\n乞与锦袍空错落，无人识得老佯狂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21645,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊花 其九","author":"黄毓祺","text":"萧然暂对破人颜，一卷茶经紫翠间。\n纵使秋霜鹰爪健，何如此种意閒閒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21646,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊花 其十","author":"黄毓祺","text":"此花不愧浅深红，得性那能与俗同。\n他日倘寻高士传，相逢只合唤黄公。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21647,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊花 其十一","author":"黄毓祺","text":"平远荒寒木叶稀，秋容不战自然肥。\n忽惊身在芦花岸，耳畔萧萧有雁飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21648,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊花 其十二","author":"黄毓祺","text":"奇姿能艳复能幽，志意坚贞不可求。\n举面向人先自赤，风前无语小低头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21649,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]